--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This mod requires the companion library "mcef-codec", which embeds a fork of
java-cef (Chromium Embedded Framework Java bindings) and downloads Chromium
binaries at runtime. Those components carry their own licences; see the
LICENSE and NOTICE files shipped with mcef-codec.

The first-person held-tablet pose and the tablet model layout are ported from
WebDisplays by montoyo, which its author released into the public domain.
